  {
    "id": 7002001030010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そうですか\r\nありがとうございます、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200103/7002001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、順調で何よりだ\r\nこれからきっと、忙しくなるぞ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今よりもたくさんの人に、灯織のことが\r\n知ってもらえるってことだ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001030020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね\r\nでは、早速レッスンを増やさないといけません",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200103/7002001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001030030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まだ第２審査を通過できただけ……先は長いですから\r\nここで気を抜くわけにはいきません",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200103/7002001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに灯織の言うとおりだが……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "少しぐらいお祝いさせてくれないか",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001030040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お祝い、ですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200103/7002001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ、何か欲しいものはあるか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001030050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "別に……特にありません",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200103/7002001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001030060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そもそも、お世話になっているのはこちらです\r\n私のほうが、お礼をしなければいけません",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200103/7002001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？　俺は別に……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、灯織をプロデュースするのが、俺の仕事だしな！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001030070,
